# SONiX — Hardware Connections, Pinout and I²C Protocol

## 1. Project Overview

SONiX is a Smart Connected Safety Gear prototype built around an ESP32-C3 Mini. It combines environmental sensing, motion monitoring, non-contact temperature measurement, visual indicators, and audible alerts.

This document covers the proposed hardware wiring, pin assignments, power requirements, and communication protocol.

**Important:** The GPIO assignments are examples, not verified connections from the physical prototype. Confirm the exact ESP32-C3 Mini board variant and module pin labels before wiring.

